*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*FormatVersion: "4.3" 
*LanguageEncoding: "ISOLatin1"
*LanguageVersion: "English"
*Manufacturer: "UGS"
*ModelName: "Solid Edge PS Writer"
*NickName: "Solid Edge PS"
*% PCFileName should be of the form XXNNNNNN.PDF where XX is an assigned
*% manufacturer code.
*PCFileName: "SolidEdgePDF.PDF"
*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*Product: "(Solid Edge)"
*PSVersion: "(3010) 815"
*ShortNickName: "Solid Edge PS"

*% *DefaultImageableArea:
*% *DefaultPageRegion:
*% *PageRegion:
*% *ImageableArea:
*% *DefaultPageSize:
*% *PageSize:
*% *DefaultPaperDimension:
*% *PaperDimension:

*% == Above are required

*Copyright: "2006 UGS Corp.  All rights reserved"
