*% Custom Page Sizes ===================
*MaxMediaWidth: "14400"
*MaxMediaHeight: "14400"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 72 14400
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 72 14400
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 3
*OrderDependency: 30 PageSetup *CustomPageSize
*CustomPageSize True: "
	4 dict begin
		/Orientation exch def
		2 array astore /Margins exch def
		2 array astore /PageSize exch def
		/ImagingBBox null def
		currentdict
	end setpagedevice
"
*End


*% == Fonts
*DefaultFont: Courier
